---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Eat & Shop
description: Every Niwot business we can source — kitchens, coffee, groceries, shops, wellness, trades and professional services across Old Town, Cottonwood Square and the roads around them. Search or filter by category.
navKey: eat-shop
permalink: /eat-shop/
ogImage: second-avenue-patios.jpg
ogImageAlt: Patios and hanging baskets on the 300 block of Second Avenue in Niwot
footMetaRight: Hours and contact details via the Business Association
scripts:
  - /assets/js/directory.js
pageStyles: |
  .n-dir{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,.3fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:clamp(24px,3vw,60px);align-items:start}
  .n-filters{position:sticky;top:88px}
  .n-pair{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:clamp(16px,2vw,32px)}
  .n-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(150px,.34fr);gap:16px 28px;align-items:start;padding:22px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--n-rule)}
  .n-cats{margin-top:8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--n-rule)}
  button[data-chip]{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;width:100%;text-align:left;padding:13px 14px;background:transparent;border:0;border-top:1px solid var(--n-rule);color:var(--n-ink);font:inherit;font-size:1rem;cursor:pointer;transition:background .18s ease,color .18s ease}
  button[data-chip]:hover{background:var(--n-paper)}
  button[data-chip][aria-pressed="true"]{background:var(--n-evergreen);color:var(--n-white)}
  button[data-chip][aria-pressed="true"] span{color:var(--n-gold-lt)}
  @media (max-width:900px){
  .n-dir,.n-pair{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}
  .n-row{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}
  /* A sticky rail in a one-column stack pins itself on top of the listings it
     is meant to filter. Below the breakpoint it is an ordinary block. */
  .n-filters{position:static}
  /* Ten categories in one column is a screenful of scrolling before the first
     business. Two columns of square tiles, one column on the narrowest
     phones, and every tile a 48px tap target. */
  .n-cats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(150px,1fr));gap:8px;border-bottom:0}
  button[data-chip]{align-items:center;min-height:48px;padding:10px 12px;font-size:.9375rem;border:1px solid var(--n-rule)}
  }
---
<section class="n-bg-white" aria-labelledby="title-h">
<div class="n-wrap" style="padding-top:clamp(28px,4vw,60px);padding-bottom:clamp(20px,2.5vw,36px)">
<div class="n-g2-wide" style="align-items:end">
<div>
<div class="n-label">Eat &amp; shop</div>
<h1 class="n-display" id="title-h" style="margin-top:14px;font-size:clamp(2.5rem,1.8rem + 3.4vw,5rem);line-height:.96;max-width:16ch;color:var(--n-evergreen)">Two blocks, and most of it independent</h1>
</div>
<p class="n-lead" style="margin:0;max-width:50ch">Kitchens, coffee, groceries and shops, nearly all of it within a short walk of Second Avenue &#8212; plus the practices, trades and offices on the roads around the two blocks.</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="n-bg-white" aria-label="Photographs of the commercial blocks">
<div class="n-wrap" style="padding-bottom:clamp(28px,3.5vw,52px)">
<div class="n-pair">
<figure style="margin:0">
{% photo "second-avenue-patios.jpg", "Brick and clapboard buildings on the 300 block of Second Avenue with hanging baskets and patio tables out front", "(max-width: 900px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width: 1440px) 46vw, 636px", "display:block;width:100%;height:clamp(200px,23vw,330px);object-fit:cover;object-position:center 56%", true %}
<figcaption class="n-cap">Second Avenue, the 300 block</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure style="margin:0">
{% photo "niwot-tavern-patios.jpg", "Umbrella-shaded patios outside the Niwot Tavern and Raza Fresa Mexican Kitchen with two bronze bear sculptures on the corner", "(max-width: 900px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width: 1440px) 46vw, 636px", "display:block;width:100%;height:clamp(200px,23vw,330px);object-fit:cover;object-position:center 52%", true %}
<figcaption class="n-cap">Cottonwood Square, bear sculptures on the corner</figcaption>
</figure>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="n-bg-white" aria-labelledby="dir-h" style="padding-bottom:clamp(44px,6vw,104px)">
<div class="n-wrap">
<div class="n-rail"></div>
<div class="n-dir" style="margin-top:clamp(24px,3vw,44px)">
<div class="n-filters">
<label class="n-label n-label--quiet" for="dir-q" style="display:block">Search</label>
<input id="dir-q" type="search" placeholder="Name, street or keyword" style="width:100%;margin-top:8px;padding:13px 14px;background:var(--n-white);border:2px solid var(--n-evergreen);font:inherit;font-size:1rem;color:var(--n-ink)">
<div class="n-label n-label--quiet" style="margin-top:26px" id="cats-h">Categories</div>
<div class="n-cats" role="group" aria-labelledby="cats-h">
{%- for c in listings.categories %}
<button type="button" data-chip="{{ c.value }}" aria-pressed="{{ 'true' if c.value == 'All' else 'false' }}">{{ c.label }} <span style="color:var(--n-muted)">{{ c.count }}</span></button>
{%- endfor %}
</div>
<a class="n-btn n-btn--ghost" href="https://niwot.com/" rel="noopener" style="margin-top:22px;width:100%">Association directory &#8599;</a>
</div>
<div>
<div class="n-shead n-shead-row" style="border-bottom-color:var(--n-evergreen)">
<h2 class="n-h2" id="dir-h" data-dir-heading style="font-size:clamp(1.5rem,1.2rem + 1.2vw,2.25rem);color:var(--n-evergreen)">Local businesses</h2>
<span aria-live="polite" class="n-label n-label--quiet" data-dir-count>{{ listings.entries.length }} listings</span>
</div>
<p class="n-small" style="margin:16px 0 0;max-width:74ch">Compiled from the Niwot Business Association directory, the Left Hand Valley Courier and each business&#8217;s own site, last checked {{ listings.verified }}. Phone numbers are not reproduced here because they change faster than anything else &#8212; each row links out for current hours and contact details. Businesses that keep no public listing will not appear; <a href="/plan-a-visit/#contact">send yours</a> and it goes in.</p>
{#- Every listing ships in the HTML; filtering only hides rows. Phone numbers
    are held with the Association rather than duplicated here, so each row
    links there or to the business's own site. -#}
<ul data-dir-list style="list-style:none;margin:clamp(18px,2vw,28px) 0 0;padding:0">
{%- for r in listings.entries %}
<li class="n-row" data-listing data-name="{{ r.name }}" data-category="{{ r.category }}" data-note="{{ r.note }}" data-area="{{ r.area }}" data-address="{{ r.address }}">
<div>
<h3 class="n-h3" style="font-size:1.5rem;color:var(--n-evergreen)">{{ r.name }}</h3>
<div class="n-label" style="margin-top:8px">{{ r.category }}</div>
{%- if r.note %}
<p class="n-body" style="margin:10px 0 0;max-width:58ch;font-size:.9375rem">{{ r.note }}</p>
{%- endif %}
</div>
<div style="display:grid;gap:8px;align-content:start">
{%- if r.address %}
<div class="n-small" style="font-size:.875rem;color:var(--n-ink)">{{ r.address }}</div>
{%- endif %}
{%- if r.area %}
<div class="n-small" style="font-size:.875rem">{{ r.area }}</div>
{%- endif %}
<a class="n-link" href="{{ r.href }}" rel="noopener" style="justify-self:start">{{ r.linkLabel }} &#8599;</a>
</div>
</li>
{%- endfor %}
</ul>
<div data-dir-empty hidden style="padding:clamp(24px,3vw,44px) 0">
<p class="n-h3" style="max-width:52ch;color:var(--n-evergreen)">Nothing matches that search.</p>
<p class="n-body" style="margin:16px 0 0;max-width:58ch">Try a different word, clear the category filter, or browse the full members&#8217; directory.</p>
<div class="n-btns" style="margin-top:22px">
<button class="n-btn n-btn--ghost" type="button" data-dir-clear style="cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit">Clear filters</button>
<a class="n-btn n-btn--ghost" href="https://niwot.com/" rel="noopener">Association directory</a>
</div>
</div>
<div class="n-g2" style="margin-top:clamp(32px,4vw,56px)">
<div class="n-callout n-callout--paper">
<div class="n-label">Own a business here?</div>
<p class="n-body" style="margin:10px 0 0;font-size:.9375rem">Send your name, category, address, phone, website and hours and it goes into the directory.</p>
<a class="n-link" href="/plan-a-visit/#contact" style="display:inline-block;margin-top:14px">Add a listing &#8594;</a>
</div>
<div class="n-callout n-callout--sky">
<div class="n-label" style="color:var(--n-sky-ink)">Planning a trip</div>
<p class="n-body" style="margin:10px 0 0;font-size:.9375rem">Parking, walking routes and accessibility notes are on the visitor page.</p>
<a class="n-link" href="/plan-a-visit/" style="display:inline-block;margin-top:14px">Plan a visit &#8594;</a>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
